{"about_the_game":"<strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Build your Firebase<br></li><li>Defend it at all costs<br></li><li>Get home alive (Optional)</li></ul></strong><br>Firebase Defence is a new spin on the traditional tower defence gameplay. You have to defend yourself from the waves upon waves of incoming enemies.<br>You are free to build, place and manage your available resources and units in any way you want. But failing to balance those will result in defeat!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/941730/extras/ce1241d3feb5da591bb12ceb9299bb75.poster.avif?t=1626782311\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/941730/extras/ce1241d3feb5da591bb12ceb9299bb75.webm?t=1626782311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/941730/extras/ce1241d3feb5da591bb12ceb9299bb75.mp4?t=1626782311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Construction!</strong> - You choose how your Firebase should look and function.<br></li><li><strong>Different units with very different play styles</strong> - Using the right combination of your units is the key to a successful defence.<br></li><li><strong>Manage ammunition</strong> - Different units uses different ammunition, you need to make sure they never run out.<br></li><li><strong>A wide variety of different enemies</strong> - From small and almost harmless, to huge and dangerous that will level your Firebase to the ground if not dealt with.<br></li><li><strong>Mission variety</strong> - Different missions require different strategies.<br></li><li><strong>Survival mode</strong> - Unlockable extra mode that gets progressively more difficult.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/941730/extras/fabf0d652297f55939d285e3728712a0.poster.avif?t=1626782311\" width=600 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/941730/extras/fabf0d652297f55939d285e3728712a0.webm?t=1626782311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/941730/extras/fabf0d652297f55939d285e3728712a0.mp4?t=1626782311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bonus Feature:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Blow up sheep! (not to be confused with inflatable sheep)</strong></li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/941730/extras/d4649b0680b25b3e16cf089c1ad11215.poster.avif?t=1626782311\" width=600 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/941730/extras/d4649b0680b25b3e16cf089c1ad11215.webm?t=1626782311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/941730/extras/d4649b0680b25b3e16cf089c1ad11215.mp4?t=1626782311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/941730?t=1626782311","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/941730?t=1626782311","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/941730/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1626782311","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/941730/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1626782311","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Contains graphic violence"},"detailed_description":"<strong><br><ul class=\"bb